QUANTUM UNRAVEL (25s · 8K · 30fps · HDR)

Tone: Sci-fi, surreal, elegant dimensional chaos
Punchline: “He exists in all threads at once.”
Style: Hyper-detailed filament fur, fluidic dimensional distortions, soft volumetric lighting, clean dark sci-fi studio space
Physics Engine: Thread-particle physics, glitch-desync timing, micro-unravel simulations

GLOBAL MOTION RULES

Filament stripes constantly micro-shift and ripple, never still.
Random patches of the tiger desynchronize 0.1–0.3 seconds from the rest of his body.
Occasional ghost-silhouette afterimages appear and fall away like loose threads.
Any limb motion leaves behind quantum trails of floating filament particles.
When he punches, parts of space briefly tear open into woven geometric lattice.

🎬 SCENE BREAKDOWN (25 seconds)
🔹 SCENE 0 — Anchor Shot (0.0–1.5s)

Camera: Slow push-in from low angle, cinematic DOF.
The filament tiger stands in a dark void. Micro-filaments ripple as if blowing in a nonexistent breeze.
A faint glitch: one ear flickers half a frame behind reality.

🔹 SCENE 1 — First Glitch Pulse (1.5–4.5s)

Action:
He steps forward. As his leg moves, three ghost copies stutter behind him — each made of semi-transparent fiber threads.
His shoulder desyncs briefly, lagging 0.2 seconds, then snaps into place with a soft thread-pop.

FX:
Floating particles drift off him like unraveling data.

🔹 SCENE 2 — Dimensional Drag (4.5–9s)

Camera: Smooth orbit around him as he moves into a fighting stance.
Action:
As he raises a paw, the air bends — a filament distortion field forms, warping space in concentric ripples.
His tail splits into three temporal copies before re-merging.

FX:
Soft lattice patterns flicker in the background: wireframe dimensions trying to resolve.

🔹 SCENE 3 — Quantum Punch (9–14s)

Action:
He punches forward.
Space in front of him tears open as a woven geometric fabric — glowing grids of threads, shifting, folding, rotating.
A shockwave of filament particles bursts outward in slow motion.

Camera:
High-speed slow-mo with micro-shake synced to the glitch.

🔹 SCENE 4 — The Unravel (14–20s)

Action:
A major glitch hits:

His chest unravels into spiraling yarn tendrils.

His head duplicates twice, each drifting like out-of-phase realities.

The entire left side of his body lags, trailing glowing after-images.

The environment shakes as if reality is buffering.

🔹 SCENE 5 — Collapse & Re-knit (20–25s)

Action:
The tiger pauses, then suddenly collapses into a cloud of swirling filament threads — a total unravel.
For a brief moment, he exists only as a vortex of colors.
Then, threads weave themselves back together into a perfect tiger shape, fully knitted and stable.

Camera:
Slow dolly-out as he lifts his head, calm and powerful.

Final note:
A single loose thread floats upward as the screen fades.